  "description": "NESJON crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C93 H93 Gd7 O38,7(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.599-3.944 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.61-111.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C107H114Gd7N7O38. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
